  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fluent assertions that return the asserted value (Option, Either, Validation, Fin, Try), Error helpers (ShouldHaveCode, ShouldHaveMessage, ShouldHaveException) that chain from ShouldBeFail(), and new IO support with sync and async assertions. Targets LanguageExt.Core 5.0.0-beta-78. Breaking: assertions now return the asserted value instead of void, so recompile against this version; a lambda declared with 'var' and passed to ShouldThrow/ShouldNotThrow must now be declared as 'Action' (see README, \"Upgrading from 0.1.0\").",
